The formal tab cites the lesson's framing only, since no source in sources/ defines a formal tool's results.

Fidelity: illustration. The bug kinds and their earliest catchers come only from the F1A lesson's shift-left table and quiz question 10:
- spec contradictions -> planning at spec review;
